---
// Broker Honor Roll — TEASER ONLY (Path C on-ramp). No fake data.
// Who registered, who got fined, who is hostile — a scoreboard for whether the
// system actually works, coming once the data is real and verifiable.
---
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-ink-800/10 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-teal-600">Coming soon</p>
      <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">The Broker Honor Roll</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide rounded-full bg-ink-100 text-ink-500 px-2.5 py-1">Teaser</span>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
    Brokers self-report their deletions. A scoreboard is how you watch whether the
    law actually works. When it opens, it will track — from public, verifiable
    sources only —
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800/10 bg-paper-50/60 px-4 py-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">Who registered</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-500">On the CPPA data broker registry, on time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800/10 bg-paper-50/60 px-4 py-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">Who got fined</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-500">Public enforcement actions and penalties.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800/10 bg-paper-50/60 px-4 py-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">Who is hostile</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-500">Dark patterns, dead links, ignored requests.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink-400">No numbers here yet — we don't publish data we can't verify.</p>
</div>
